===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|horticulture}} The act, art, or process of inserting [[graft]]s.
# {{lb|en|nautical}} The act or method of [[weaving]] a cover for a ring, [[rope]] [[end]], etc.
# {{lb|en|surgery}} The [[transplanting]] of a [[portion]] of [[flesh]], [[hair]] or [[skin]] to a [[denuded]] [[surface]]; [[autoplasty]].
# {{lb|en|carpentry}} A [[scarfing]] or [[endwise]] [[attachment]] of one [[timber]] to another.

